      "side": 1,
      "message": "I tried with what Luca suggested, using DynamicMap to see if I could overcome some of the issues I mention above, however, it seems to me that the Cache\u003c?, ?\u003e objects are instances of Guava\u0027s Cache interface, which is a generic type. Due to Java\u0027s type erasure, the generic type parameters are not available at runtime.\n\nSo I don\u0027t think that approach will work either.",
